{"id":"f7c978c7cd80eed3","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle.md","title":"Reversible Boolean Evaluation Oracle","display":"df-reversible-boolean-oracle — Reversible Boolean Evaluation Oracle","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle","aliases":["28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle"],"display":"df-reversible-boolean-oracle — Reversible Boolean Evaluation Oracle","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.3.7 and §10.4","source_printed_pages":"215,218","source_pdf_pages":"241,244","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-reversible-boolean-oracle — Reversible Boolean Evaluation Oracle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.3.7 and §10.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"215,218"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"241,244"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}^m\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}^m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span> 为逐位模二加法。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_f\">\\(U_f\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C^{\\{0,1\\}^{n+m}}\">\\(\\mathbb C^{\\{0,1\\}^{n+m}}\\)</span> 上由标准基作用线性延拓的算子。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U_f|x,z\\rangle\\coloneqq|x,z\\oplus f(x)\\rangle\\qquad(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n,\\ z\\in\\{0,1\\}^m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U_f|x,z\\rangle\\coloneqq|x,z\\oplus f(x)\\rangle\\qquad(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n,\\ z\\in\\{0,1\\}^m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U_f^2=I,\\qquad U_f^\\dagger=U_f,\\qquad U_f^\\dagger U_f=I.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U_f^2=I,\\qquad U_f^\\dagger=U_f,\\qquad U_f^\\dagger U_f=I.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>基向量的映射是自身逆的置换，因此存在唯一线性延拓且为幺正。这里只定义抽象求值算子；门规模是否多项式另需给f的有效电路，不在定义中暗加效率结论。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.3.7 and §10.4；印刷页 215,218；PDF 页 241,244。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第10章的 Reversible Boolean Evaluation Oracle，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\oplus","display":false},{"tex":"U_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb C^{\\{0,1\\}^{n+m}}","display":false},{"tex":"U_f|x,z\\rangle\\coloneqq|x,z\\oplus f(x)\\rangle\\qquad(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n,\\ z\\in\\{0,1\\}^m).","display":true},{"tex":"U_f^2=I,\\qquad U_f^\\dagger=U_f,\\qquad U_f^\\dagger U_f=I.","display":true}],"bytes":1578,"backlinks":[{"id":"3bcf14b20009dcce","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$U_f$ 见 [[28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-321","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-tensor-product-state]]、[[28-df-hadamard-transform]]、[[28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle]]、[[28-lem-phase-kickback]]、[[28-df-grover-iterate]]、[[28-thm-grover-success-amplitude]]、[[28-df-simon-promise-problem]]、[[28-df-quantum-fourier-transform]]、[[28-lem-nontrivial-square-root-factor]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}